/P 313 0 R
/E (from a specific inbox. The email body is then processed using NLP models such as BERT, GPT, or TF-IDF to generate concise and meaningful summaries, helping users quickly understand the essence of an email without reading lengthy content. Simultaneously, the system identifies and downloads attachments such as PDFs, images, and documents, storing them in a designated folder for easy access. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
452 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 313 0 R
/E (The proposed system integrates with email services using IMAP or Gmail API to fetch emails The increasing volume of emails in corporate and academic environments, manually processing and extracting key information from emails has become a challenging task. AI-powered mail summarization and attachment extraction using Python provides an automated solution to efficiently manage emails. This approach involves Natural Language Processing \(NLP\) and Machine Learning \(ML\) techniques to summarize email content while ensuring that all attachments are systematically downloaded for further processing. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
453 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 313 0 R
/E (This AI-powered approach significantly improves productivity, reduces manual effort, and enhances email management by prioritizing important messages and ensuring essential attachments are readily available. The implementation of such a system can benefit professionals, researchers, and businesses by streamlining email workflow and information retrieval. Future enhancements may include sentiment analysis, email categorization, and intelligent response generation, making email processing even more efficient. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
