481 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 316 0 R
/E (The Certificate Validation Using AI project aims to develop an automated, secure, and scalable system for validating the authenticity of digital or physical certificates. Traditional certificate validation methods are often manual, time-consuming, and prone to errors or fraud. This project leverages Artificial Intelligence \(AI\) technologies, including Optical Character Recognition \(OCR\), Machine Learning \(ML\), Natural Language Processing \(NLP\), and Computer Vision, to streamline the validation process, detect fraudulent certificates, and ensure trust and reliability. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
