/P 324 0 R
/E (16 )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
614 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 324 0 R
/E (intervention. The integration of Ai technology further strengthens data security by preventing tampering and ensuring the legitimacy of credentials. Moreover, these systems are highly scalable, allowing organizations to process large volumes of certificates simultaneously, making them ideal for universities, employers, and certification authorities handling vast numbers of applicants. With AI-powered certificate validation, industries can significantly reduce fraud, improve trust in digital credentials, and establish a more reliable and transparent authentication process. As digital transformation continues to reshape global industries, AI-driven validation systems are becoming an essential tool in safeguarding the integrity of certifications and credentials worldwide. )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
