742 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 330 0 R
/E (However, to conquer this issue and provides data for the research, the researcher collected data from the Unizik Exams and Records department, based on the Letter of Permission written to the Registrar of the School \(see the copy of the Letter in appendix A\). However, the primary source of data is from the Unizik Exams and Records department which provided data of certificates and other non-sensitive official documents of the university from 2016-2020. The sample size of data collected here is 1120 which consist of 970 first degree certificates and 150 postgraduate certificates. These data collected in the primary source was integrated together as the training dataset alongside 40 data collected from Alumni. )
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
