/S /P
/P 331 0 R
/E (Image binarization is found useful in many image processing applications due to its simplicity and effectiveness. This process was used for the mitigation of excess color frequency in the data into bi-level as in black and white. This way the quality of data being queried will be the same with that of the training dataset. )
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
