1380 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 368 0 R
/E (The implementation of the AI-based certificate validation system involves multiple stages, including data preprocessing, OCR-based text extraction, AI-driven fraud detection, and real-time validation. The system was successfully developed and tested using a combination of HTML, CSS, and JavaScript for the front-end interface and Python-based machine learning algorithms for the back-end processing. The implementation began with the development of a user-friendly web interface that allows users to upload certificate images for validation. The system then applies Optical Character Recognition \(OCR\) to extract text from the uploaded document, converting it into machine-readable format. After text extraction, Natural Language Processing \(NLP\) and machine learning models analyze the extracted data and compare it with trusted certificate records using cosine similarity-based fraud detection. The system effectively identifies tampered or forged documents )
/Pg 68 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
