/P 373 0 R
/E (The AI-based certificate validation system provides an efficient, secure, and automated approach to verifying the authenticity of academic, professional, and official certificates. By leveraging Optical Character Recognition \(OCR\), Natural Language Processing \(NLP\), and Machine Learning \(ML\) algorithms, the system accurately extracts and analyzes certificate details, minimizing human effort and reducing errors in manual verification. The integration of AI-driven fraud detection ensures that tampered or forged documents are quickly identified, enhancing the reliability and security of the validation process. )
/Pg 73 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
1462 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
