/P 373 0 R
/E (The successful implementation and testing of the system demonstrate its high accuracy, scalability, and real- time processing capabilities, making it a valuable tool for educational institutions, employers, and organizations that require certificate authentication. The system can be further improved by incorporating blockchain technology for tamper-proof digital records and expanding the database of verified certificates for broader applicability. )
/Pg 73 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
